language Essence 1.3

$ Scaling guard for set (representation occurrence) over a large inner domain.
$
$ `i in s` under occurrence lowers to one disjunct per inner-domain value, so the rewriter does
$ O(n) rule applications inside a single very wide `or`. That makes this model a sensitive probe
$ for per-rewrite costs that scale with model size: the recorded rule-attempt counts in stats.toml
$ must stay linear in the inner-domain size, and expected-time must not creep up.

find i : int(1..100)
find s : set (representation occurrence, size 2) of int(1..200)

such that i in s, |s| = 2
